# @umbraco-cms v18 packages aren't on the public npm registry yet — they ship to MyGet's
# umbracoprereleases feed alongside the NuGet prereleases. Once v18 stable lands on npm,
# remove this file and re-pin peer deps to the public registry.
@umbraco-cms:registry=https://www.myget.org/F/umbracoprereleases/npm/
